WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.781 --> 00:00:01.700
- [Narrator] This is what it sounds like

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.867
when 3,500 people are eating together.

00:00:06.268 --> 00:00:09.077
And another 3,500.

00:00:09.077 --> 00:00:10.077
And another.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.504
In total, today, the
Shirdi Sai Baba Temple

00:00:14.504 --> 00:00:15.834
in Maharashtra, India

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:19.531
will serve lunch to at least
40,000 people for free.

00:00:19.531 --> 00:00:23.198
And this happens every
day, 365 days a year.

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:33.980
The temple was built in 2008,
around a specific philosophy

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.397
by spiritual leader Sai Baba.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.307
This is the man in charge.

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:56.985
He supervises the kitchen, or mega kitchen

00:00:56.985 --> 00:01:00.152
as this is one of the largest in Asia.

00:01:01.605 --> 00:01:05.105
The day, it starts at 6:30 in the morning.

00:01:16.764 --> 00:01:18.574
Some people are cooking vegetables.

00:01:18.574 --> 00:01:19.967
Some clean utensils.

00:01:19.967 --> 00:01:22.454
Some are responsible for the bread.

00:01:22.454 --> 00:01:23.371
You get it.

00:01:25.862 --> 00:01:27.471
Every day, the meal is different.

00:01:27.471 --> 00:01:30.221
But the ratio is always the same.

00:01:40.869 --> 00:01:43.883
To make these plates
for 40,000 people a day,

00:01:43.883 --> 00:01:45.800
it takes a lot of food.

00:01:46.735 --> 00:01:48.155
Here are the numbers.

00:01:48.155 --> 00:01:49.655
3.3 tons of bread.

00:01:50.665 --> 00:01:52.920
Two tons of vegetables.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.192
Nearly one ton of lentils.

00:01:55.192 --> 00:01:58.120
And half a ton of dessert.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:59.944
Now, to make all this food,

00:01:59.944 --> 00:02:02.944
the kitchen requires a lot of power.

00:02:07.141 --> 00:02:10.458
The roof is covered in solar panels.

00:02:10.458 --> 00:02:12.583
So, it's clear this temple's initiatives

00:02:12.583 --> 00:02:15.000
are something to be proud of.

